**SoundClud {{RELEASE_TAG}}** brings zero-compromise **`0 dB` Bit-Perfect (`44.1 kHz / 24-bit`)** audio handoff from the official [soundcloud.com](https://soundcloud.com) web player directly to **Denon & Marantz HEOS Built-In** network amplifiers/speakers and **Optical TOSLINK (S/PDIF)** Hi-Fi DACs.

Browse, queue, scrub waveforms across multi-hour DJ mixes, and press your keyboard's hardware media keys inside `soundcloud.com` as normal—while your computer's internal speakers stay silent and your Hi-Fi amplifier plays bit-perfect lossless audio controlled exclusively by your physical amplifier volume knob or remote.

